## Erlang node name and cookie. Needed by bin/lora_mesh (ping, stop,
## remote_console) and by clusters of lora_mesh machines (role bridge).
## Change the cookie before joining machines together.
-sname lora_mesh
-setcookie lora_mesh_change_me

## Two or more machines (role full + role bridge): use full names with the
## machine's own address, so the other side can always resolve it, e.g.
##   -name lora_mesh@192.168.10.11
## and fix the distribution ports, to open them in a firewall or VLAN ACL
## (plus 4369/tcp for epmd):
##   -kernel inet_dist_listen_min 9100 inet_dist_listen_max 9105
